From c2df58ae15d17c280a6c7d6d8f7019532094c281 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wei Wang <wanw@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Jan 2026 16:51:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] add lxc-daemon tool


Signed-off-by: Wei Wang <wanw@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
